# NOTE: the original shareware game files in original/ ARE committed on purpose.
# They are tiny (~185 KB total), freely-distributable 1993 shareware, and serve
# as the ground-truth reference for the recompilation. The unpacked image and
# analysis output under work/ are NOT committed — they regenerate in one command:
#   python tools/unpklite.py original/BOLO3.EXE work/BOLO3_image.bin --mz work/BOLO3_unpacked.exe
!original/
